sequenceDiagram
  actor N as Nora
  participant A as Nora's app
  participant St as Storage
  participant DB as PostgREST + PostgreSQL
  participant B as Samir's app
  actor S as Samir
  N->>A: picks a picture, writes, sends
  A->>St: upload msg_timestamp.jpg (chat-pictures)
  St-->>A: getPublicUrl
  A->>DB: insert messages {sender, receiver, content, image_url}
  DB-->>A: row created, added to the conversation
  S->>B: opens Messages
  B->>DB: select friends, then last message and unread count per friend
  DB-->>B: nora, 1 unread
  S->>B: opens the conversation
  B->>DB: update messages set seen = true (received from nora)
  B->>DB: select the conversation's messages
  Note over A,DB: Nora sees blue ticks the next time the conversation loads
